.DS_Store

# Local-only subscriber notification data. These contain real parent emails and
# children's names, which must never enter this public repo. Unlike the relay
# rosters in data/internal_relay_sources/, an email address cannot be hashed and
# stay useful for sending, so the whole file stays local. See
# docs/subscriber-notifications.md.
# The trailing * is load-bearing, not sloppiness: write_json() writes an atomic temp sibling
# ("data/notify_log.local.json.tmp") before renaming it into place. Ignoring only the exact .json
# names left that temp file tracked, so a crash inside the write window -- the very case the
# per-send flush exists to survive -- could leave every real subscriber address staged by a
# routine "git add -A".
data/subscribers.local.json*
data/notify_log.local.json*
